Subject: [PATCH 14/14] sandbox: implement LocalShellBackend with
 capability-gated execute tool

Adds dev-only shell execution (opt-in via SANDBOX_TYPE=local-shell) so the
SmartAgent can run real coding tasks during development. The execute tool
binds and surfaces in the system prompt only when the active backend
implements ShellBackendProtocol, keeping state/local backends safe by default.

